# API conventions

## Shape

- Versioned paths: `/v1/...`
- External JSON: `snake_case` fields matching `docs/OFFRAMP_FLOW.md`.
- Internal TS: `camelCase`. Map at the boundary once.

## Responses

- Success: explicit DTO; no raw DB rows.
- Errors: `{ "error": { "code": "QUOTE_EXPIRED", "message": "..." } }`: stable `code`, safe `message`.
- Never return macaroons, preimages (except settle internals), or full MSISDNs in logs/error payloads (mask).

## HTTP semantics

| Action | Status |
|--------|--------|
| Quote created | `201` |
| Status fetch | `200` |
| Validation fail | `400` |
| Business reject (float/liquidity) | `409` or `503` as documented |
| Unknown id | `404` |

## Efficiency

- Quote endpoint: cheap FX + invoice create; no MoMo transfer.
- Status endpoint: read model only: no side effects.
